  1.         cap label drop stand_lab
  2.     label define stand_lab      1 "1. Adambakam" 2 "2. Avadi" 3 "3. Aynava
> ram" 4 "4. Mandaveli" 5 "5. MKB" 6 "6. Korattur" 7 "7. MMDA" ///
