.         * Purpose: Auxiliary function to install any uninstalled ssc packages
>  before using them
.         * Author: Unknown
.         * Last modified: Unknown
.         cap program drop verify_package 

.         program verify_package
  1.                 args package
  2.                 capture which `package'
  3.                 if _rc ssc install `package'
  4.                 if !_rc di "Package `package' already installed in the sys
> tem. Code can proceed."
  5.         end

